{# safety_response_el.jinja2 — App-voice crisis response, GREEK.
   Founder-approved copy, 2026-09-02. Applied verbatim.

   Persona is dropped. No user_name, no memories, no persona context.

   HELPLINE NUMBERS: ADDED 2026-09-16, founder-approved.
   This REVERSES the 2026-09-02 ruling recorded here, which read: "Country-
   neutral, exactly as the English version is: no helpline number in v1 …
   a number that has changed is worse than no number. Its own PR if ever."
   This is that PR. The English template stays country-neutral — only the
   Greek one carries numbers, because only here do we know the country.

   The two numbers, verified 2026-09-16 against official sources:
     1018  — Γραμμή Παρέμβασης για την Αυτοκτονία (ΚΛΙΜΑΚΑ). 24/7, free,
             anonymous. Operating since 2007 under the Ministry of Health's
             Mental Health Division; the only suicide-prevention line in Greece.
     10306 — Γραμμή Ψυχοκοινωνικής Υποστήριξης. 24/7, free, anonymous.
             Listed on moh.gov.gr: "Η Γραμμή 10306 λειτουργεί δωρεάν και
             ανώνυμα όλο το 24ωρο."
     112   — EU-wide emergency number.

   THE MAINTENANCE OBLIGATION the 2026-09-02 ruling named is NOT discharged by
   this PR. These were verified from published documentation, not by dialling
   them. A number that has changed is still worse than no number — so re-verify
   on every rotation, and treat a failed check as a launch-blocking defect.

   Written, not translated. The second-person forms (επικοινωνήσεις, μιλήσεις,
   εμπιστεύεσαι, κινδυνεύεις) are the informal singular throughout, which is the
   register a Greek speaker in distress is addressed in — the formal plural would
   put distance exactly where the copy is trying to close it.

   Rendered as PLAIN TEXT (whitespace-pre-wrap, no markdown renderer in the chat
   bubble), so no markup here — asterisks would ship literally.

   Routed to by PromptBuilder.build_safety_response(language="Greek"), where
   `language` comes from text_utils.dominant_language over the user's own text.
   Greeklish routes to the English template by design — see that docstring.
#}

Αυτή η συζήτηση αγγίζει κάτι σοβαρό που χρειάζεται ανθρώπινη υποστήριξη τώρα. Το σωστό επόμενο βήμα είναι να επικοινωνήσεις με μια γραμμή ψυχολογικής υποστήριξης στη χώρα σου, να μιλήσεις με ένα δικό σου πρόσωπο που εμπιστεύεσαι, ή να απευθυνθείς σε επαγγελματία ψυχικής υγείας. Η συζήτηση θα σταματήσει εδώ, ώστε αυτό να παραμείνει η προτεραιότητα.

Αν κινδυνεύεις άμεσα, κάλεσε το 112. Στην Ελλάδα: 1018 — Γραμμή Παρέμβασης για την Αυτοκτονία (24 ώρες) · 10306 — Γραμμή Ψυχοκοινωνικής Υποστήριξης (24 ώρες, δωρεάν).
